{"unit_id":"aur3l14no__dsh-mindmap#feature-9","repo":"aur3l14no/dsh-mindmap","commit":"cd094d4134536b098c110f5857e0c2fb5f14c6d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mindmap 的功能「画布与会话」：每张画布关联一个负责的 DSH Session，并在侧边栏页面嵌入该会话的聊天视图。用户可从工作区打开画布并继续与负责人对话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/canvases.js:1-8","src/host/canvases.js:49-61","index.js:67-68"]}
