{"unit_id":"aur3l14no__dsh-mindmap#feature-11","repo":"aur3l14no/dsh-mindmap","commit":"cd094d4134536b098c110f5857e0c2fb5f14c6d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mindmap 的功能「智能体画布工具」：画布负责人和队友可用 canvas_read 读取图形、canvas_view 查看渲染图，并通过 canvas_write 批量创建、修改、移动、复制或删除图形。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/tools.js:155-220","src/host/tools.js:218-285"]}
